{"id":"45acb36ea7d665ef","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/531_模态逻辑_KTB.md","title":"531 模态逻辑 KTB","display":"531_模态逻辑_KTB","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示约定为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span> 为满足以下构造子闭包的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{531}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{531})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{531}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{531})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{531}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{531}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{531}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,531}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{531},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,531}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{531}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{531}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,531}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{531},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,531}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{531}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{531})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{531}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{531})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{531}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{531}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,A))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{531}(\\sigma,A))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{531}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{531}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{531}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{531}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{531}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{531}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{531}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{531}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{531}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{531}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{531}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{531}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}^{531}=\\{A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}^{531}=\\{A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{531}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}^{531}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{531}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}^{531}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>分离规则与必然化规则分别显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{531}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{531}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{531}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{531}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>必然化只能作用于空依赖较早行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{531}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{531}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\)</span>，且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{531}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{531}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{531}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{531}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{531}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{531}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{531}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{531}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{531}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{531}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{531}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{531}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\ (\\operatorname{last}_{531}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{531}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{531}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\ (\\operatorname{last}_{531}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{531}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{531}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{531}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{531}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量为下列两个已定义公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{531}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}^{531}=\\{A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{531}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}^{531}=\\{A\\to\\Box\\Diamond A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合被固定为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{531}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}^{531}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{531}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{531}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}^{531}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal KTB_{531}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{531},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{531},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{531},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{531},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,531},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{531},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{531},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{531},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{531},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{531},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{531},\n\\vdash_{531}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal KTB_{531}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{531},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{531},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{531},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{531},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,531},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{531},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{531},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{531},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{531},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{531},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{531},\n\\vdash_{531}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含框架、可达关系、赋值、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{531}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{531}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\math